2 CLEAR300
5 CLS
10 REM           CONVERSION
15 T=17
20 PRINT"HELLO, I AM A COMPUTER AND I WOULD LIKE TO TAKE WITH YOU."
30 PRINT
40 PRINT"WHAT WOULD YOU LIKE TO TAKE ABOUT?";
50 LINE INPUT H$
60 R=-999
62 H$=H$+" "
65 RESTORE
70 FOR S=1TOT
80 READ M$
90 READ A$
100 IF INSTR(H$,M$)>0 AND V(S/2+.5)> R THEN R=V(S/2+.5):T$=A$:L=S/2+.5
110 NEXT S
120 PRINTT$
130 V(L)=V(L)-1
135 H$="":M$="":T$=""
140 GOTO 50   
150 DATA FAMILY,HOW DO YOU FEEL ABOUT YOUR FAMILY?
160 DATA NO,PLEASE EXPLAIN.
170 DATA NO,I DON'T UNDERSTAND.
180 DATA NO,ARE YOU SURE?
190 DATA NO,HOW LONG HAVE YOU FELT THIS WAY?
200 DATA  ,GO ON PLEASE.
210 DATA IT,WHAT ARE YOU REFERING TO WHEN YOU SAY 'IT'?
220 DATA HELP,DO YOU BELIVE THAT IT'S YOUR JOB TO HELP YOURSELF?
230 DATA COMPUTERS,WHAT ARE YOU FEELINGS ABOUT COMPUTERS?
240 DATA YOU,DO YOU TRUST ME?
250 DATA YES,WHY?
260 DATA YES,ARE YOU SURE?
270 DATA YES,YOUR ATTITUDE IS GOOD. BUT WHAT ABOUT THE END RESULTS?
280 DATA ?,DO YOU MIND IT ASK THE QUESTIONS PLEASE?
290 DATA SEX,WHAT IS THE PROBLEM?
300 DATA FEAR,WE ALL HAVE FEAR. IT IS NATURAL. DOES IT GO BEYOND NORMAL FEAR?
310 DATA LOVE,I AM TOLD THAT LOVE CAN BE BEUTIFUL. IS THIS TRUE?
